<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">2 Yanisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Yanisa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Tape ciimazappe; tumappe ta dosiza doretida godateysinne izi naytas, tana xala gidonta tumu erizayti wuri dosizaris, kitetida kita; <verse number="2" style="v"/>Gasoykka haysi tummay ha7ikka nu giddon dizaysanne sinthafekka medhinas danaysakko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossa awappenne iza na Yesuss Kirstosappe Kiyatethi, marotethiine saroy tumanine siqqon nunara giido. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ne naytape bagati aawape nus imetida azazoza mala tuman miini dizayta ta beyida gish daro ufa7istadis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ha7ikka Godateye, kassepeka dizaro attiin ta nes hara ooratha azazo xafikke; hesiikka nu nu garsan siqistanaysakko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>He siqoykka nu iza azazoza mala danaysako. Azazozikka inte koyro siyda mala siqqon deyana malako. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesus Kirstossay asa asho maydi yibeyna giza amanonta daro balethizayti alame bolla laletida. Heyta malay ay assikka as ballethizadene Kirstosara eqetizadeko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inte gidikko inte dabura wagape mella atontamalanne kumetha woyytto ekana mala inte hu7es nagetite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kirstossa timrte mala donta urayinne iza tmirteppe baletidi kare keziza ura oonanikka Xoossi deena. Kirstosa timrten dizadey gidiko izas aawayne aawa nay deetes. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Oonikka intekko yishe hessa he timrteza ekii yonta ura mokkii ekofiitene saro gopiite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Moki ekiddii ba so gelthizadey he ura oothon izara isino gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">wursetha sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta intes xafanas koyza daro miish des shin waraqataninne qalamen xafana mala koyke. Gidiikokka nu ufaysay kumeth gidana mala ta inteko bada inte sinthan intenara hasa7anas ufays oothays. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Doretidari naytii ne miicheyi nayti nena saro geetes.</para>
</usx>
